{"reviewId": "45607963_85s8d4n2X", "review": {"abstract": "长波衰退的后半期（2010—2015年）可能是一个相对稳定的国际环境，从而为追赶国的经济转型提供了某些有利条件。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "chapterUid": 11, "content": "以此估算，现在正是第五次康波的萧条后半期，第六次康波，目前看有可能是由我们跟美国共同主导的新一轮的产业革命，回升期在2026-2035，之后迎来繁荣期，这正与我们的2035，2050目标重合", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "16762-16818", "createTime": 1765926847, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 11, "reviewId": "45607963_85s8d4n2X", "userVid": 45607963, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "author": {"userVid": 45607963, "name": "孔月Kevin", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83epQ12VSxQ1N0qXyA2cjXtickp6OUW4lmZRAPg8s329ibRbtCcR3XDOvwuMQod90jgcWUVud6FN3Iq2g/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "读书，运动，思考", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-1000", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 1000}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 33, "likes": [{"userVid": 62629558, "name": "刘晓晴", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/S4eZ1S9NekCAEQnvfrshBibuMRSmeUFPxgkibkt2RibiaRruYEVe3Z5u0icQB7MTCArGwYnsQrKHzBXuvOf863c8zBNgUbpP7xeoiaibpkOdBuh2uE/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20241125-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}], "commentsCount": 12, "hotComments": [{"content": "还早了点儿，美债没有爆发大的之前还远远算不上萧条期结束", "reviewId": "45607963_85s8d4n2X", "commentId": "45607963_85s8d4n2X_c82808379_89PAy2SPp", "userVid": 82808379, "createTime": 1781345672, "likesCount": 6, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 82808379, "name": "nning", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/9WrbjEHtDy6B4QAWibujTE4sRmUUyMgGJtUCw7kQ4whFib111QdnYTykf4mBOxsV2rmDra9kwrTria41UUia1ecQKw/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": ""}}, {"content": "回升期也是过后看才会发现，按金涛先生的观点，回升期伴随的是制造业生产端先回暖，这中间还会有波动，甚至回落，有点像波浪理论中的一浪二浪，想想去年以来的几个信号：1.4月结束通缩；2.4月可能结束本轮中国的降准降息周期；3.围绕光通信、存储、人工智能硬件、电力、算力的上游制造业业绩大涨；4.下游消费仍然不行，但围绕本轮人工智能革命周期的产业链已经加速向上下游转移；5.资源品种已经走入正周期。5年后我们再看，也许这就是本轮康波周期的最低点", "reviewId": "45607963_85s8d4n2X", "toCommentId": "45607963_85s8d4n2X_c73185342_895xPOSLv", "toUserVid": 73185342, "commentId": "45607963_85s8d4n2X_c45607963_895CQelBF", "userVid": 45607963, "createTime": 1778734962, "likesCount": 5, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 45607963, "name": "孔月Kevin", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83epQ12VSxQ1N0qXyA2cjXtickp6OUW4lmZRAPg8s329ibRbtCcR3XDOvwuMQod90jgcWUVud6FN3Iq2g/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "读书，运动，思考", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-1000", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 1000}}, "replyUser": {"userVid": 73185342, "name": "苗鑫", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0010-2uSEqhJ4tOjVFBB2p~3yme5/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "苗鑫", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "本人有牛皮癣也就是银屑病", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M12-